              {/* Econ chart render script + CSS live in EconCharts.astro
                  (2026-07-11 extraction) — it renders no markup of its own,
                  it just draws into the .econ-chart-svg shells built above.
                  Guarded on isEconomy alone (matching the essay section
                  above): the render script's own per-chart data-length
                  checks already no-op safely if hubSections ever came back
